FACTORY_DEF * TeeFactory   FACTORY_NAME "DTStamperYYYY-MM-DD_HH:MI:SS.sss_8 Input Input Collector"   INPUT FEATURE_TYPE StringConcatenator_10_OUTPUT   OUTPUT FEATURE_TYPE DTStamperYYYY-MM-DD_HH:MI:SS.sss_8_Input
